 gateway as the central focal point. The environment is industrial and expansive, with multiple levels, walkways, and structural elements suggesting a space station, research lab, or advanced military installation.\",\n    \"color_palette\": {\n      \"dominant_tones\": \"Cool blues, deep purples, and silvers dominate the scene, creating a cold, technological atmosphere.\",\n      \"accent_colors\": \"Bright cyan and electric blue emanate from the central portal's core, providing the primary light source. Faint yellow-green highlights outline the portal's rim. Dim red emergency lights are visible on support pillars in the background.\",\n      \"overall_mood\": \"The color scheme evokes a sense of mystery, advanced technology, and potential danger or otherworldly origin.\"\n    },\n    \"key_elements\": [\n      {\n        \"element_name\": \"Central Portal\",\n        \"description\": \"A colossal, circular structure resembling a hyperdrive, wormhole, or dimensional gate. Its surface is metallic and segmented. The core glows intensely with swirling patterns of blue and purple light, forming a tunnel effect that recedes into darkness. A bright, circular ring of light frames the inner chamber.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"element_name\": \"Access Staircase\",\n        \"description\": \"A metal staircase with railings leads up to the portal's entrance. Several figures can be seen ascending the stairs toward the glowing center. The stairs are illuminated by the portal's light.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"element_name\": \"Foreground Figure\",\n        \"description\": \"A lone human figure in dark attire runs across a lower platform in the foreground, moving from right to left. Their motion adds dynamism to the otherwise static scene. They appear small relative to the scale of the portal.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"element_name\": \"Facility Infrastructure\",\n        \"description\": \"The room is filled with industrial elements: metal scaffolding, support beams, overhead conduits, and platforms. Large windows or viewports in the background show a starry night sky, reinforcing the space-based setting. Yellow safety lines mark walkways.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"element_name\": \"Support Structures\",\n        \"description\": \"Tall, cylindrical pillars and complex frameworks of steel girders and pipes surround the portal, emphasizing its immense size and the engineering complexity required to contain it.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"lighting_and_atmosphere\": {\n      \"primary_light_source\": \"The central portal itself acts as the main light source, casting a cool, ethereal glow throughout the immediate vicinity.\",\n      \"secondary_lighting\": \"Ambient overhead lighting provides minimal illumination elsewhere, leaving much of the facility in shadow, which enhances the contrast and mystery of the glowing portal.\",\n      \"atmospheric_effects\": \"Subtle haze or mist is visible near the base of the portal and around the running figure, adding depth and a slightly surreal quality to the air.\"\n    },\n    \"composition\": {\n      \"perspective\": \"The image is composed from a low-angle viewpoint, looking up toward the towering portal, which emphasizes its monumental scale.\",\n      \"focal_point\": \"The glowing core of the portal is the undeniable focal point, drawing the viewer's eye inward.\",\n      \"guiding_lines\": \"The staircase, railings, and structural beams create strong diagonal and vertical lines that guide the eye toward the central action.\"\n    }\n  }\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 559, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 216, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [557], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name":